sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant FL as Flutter
    participant H as Handler
    participant DS as SessionUsecase
    participant AU as AuthUsecase
    participant RD as Redis
    participant PG as PostgreSQL

    FL->>H: POST /user/logout
    activate H
    H->>DS: RevokeOnLogout
    DS->>RD: DEL auth:session:{uid}
    H->>AU: Logout(accessToken)
    AU->>PG: 删除该用户全部 refresh token
    H-->>FL: 200 ok
    deactivate H

    Note over FL,PG: 白名单账号不写 Redis，登出等价于只清客户端本地凭据
